    <briefdescription>
<para>This is the &quot;xtcTest&quot; extension. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It can be used to set up common test behavior on a per-project level, similar to the &quot;application&quot; configuration in the Gradle built-in plugins. </para>
<para>As with every other extension, by convention, it should be possible to change, extend or override parts of it on individual test task level. </para>
<para>Test filtering (include/exclude) is handled at the source set level, not here. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
